Package: dwarfs-fm
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 dwarfs | dwarfs-tools,
 fuse3
Recommends:
 dwarfs-viewer,
 dwarfs-archiver,
 7zip | p7zip-full,
 squashfs-tools
Description: File-manager helper for DwarFS images
 dwarfs-fm mounts and unmounts DwarFS images at sibling directories and
 launches dwarfs-viewer / dwarfs-archiver for Caja and Nemo plugins.

Package: dwarfs-viewer
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 dwarfs-fm,
 dwarfs | dwarfs-tools,
 fuse3
Description: GUI viewer for DwarFS filesystem images
 Tauri-based viewer with metadata, content navigator (FUSE mount), and
 integrity (dwarfsck) tabs. Default handler for .dwarfs / .dwfs / .dw.

Package: dwarfs-archiver
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 dwarfs-fm,
 dwarfs | dwarfs-tools
Recommends:
 7zip | p7zip-full,
 squashfs-tools,
 dwarfs-viewer
Description: GUI archiver for creating and converting DwarFS images
 Interactive progress UI around mkdwarfs / dwarfsextract, including
 convert-from-zip/7z/squashfs and optional open-in-viewer when done.

Package: caja-dwarfs
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 caja,
 dwarfs-fm,
 dwarfs-viewer,
 dwarfs-archiver
Description: Caja context-menu plugin for DwarFS
 Adds a DwarFS submenu: Open, Archive, Unarchive, Check integrity,
 Convert to DwarFS, Mount, and Unmount.

Package: nemo-dwarfs
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 nemo,
 dwarfs-fm,
 dwarfs-viewer,
 dwarfs-archiver
Description: Nemo context-menu plugin for DwarFS
 Adds a DwarFS submenu: Open, Archive, Unarchive, Check integrity,
 Convert to DwarFS, Mount, and Unmount.

Package: dwarfs-utils
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 dwarfs-fm,
 dwarfs-viewer,
 dwarfs-archiver
Recommends:
 caja-dwarfs,
 nemo-dwarfs
Description: Desktop suite for DwarFS images
 Metapackage pulling in the DwarFS Viewer, Archiver, and file-manager
 helper. File-manager plugins are recommended separately.
